The next residual exposed the real issue: the invariant was anchored on source `While(...)`, but the supplied semantics recurs at its internal `#while(...)` loop head. That prevented circularity and caused a second concrete unrolling. I’m moving only the loop claim’s anchor to `#while`; the whole-function claim still starts from the source AST and reaches that internal head through the fixed semantics.
